Cell["\<\
referenceBands uses the {{kx,ky,kz},{energy1,energy2,...}} record format \
returned by vaspEig. H is evaluated at 2 Pi times each reciprocal-fractional \
k point.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"79dc133c-cd2f-4357-b44f-a67469df28f4"],

Cell["\<\
Every ordinary symbolic parameter in H receives a slider from -1 to 1 with \
initial value 0. The ExportData button prints the current parameter rules; it \
does not write a file.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"f8339193-e42f-4dba-8855-54c60c1fdf5a"],

Cell["\<\
Tight-binding bands are black and reference bands are red. The displayed \
energy range is the reference range expanded by 0.2 at each end.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"417743ed-75b2-486e-9267-4950793705a7"],

Cell["\<\
bandManipulateEig has no public options and returns a Manipulate expression.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"e8272897-cfd6-4634-b40d-6cd8f5bb8a2e"],

Cell["\<\
A malformed Hamiltonian, malformed reference data, Subscript or Indexed \
parameters, or unresolved function heads return a descriptive Failure; the \
function does not substitute a numerical fallback.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"77ea3819-7bf1-41a7-8b2d-642b18428129"]
}, Closed]],

